declare distributions to our limited partners on a monthly basis during the
period of this offering and pay such distributions on a quarterly basis (without
interest). Thereafter, we intend to make distributions to the limited partners
on a quarterly basis. However, because we have not identified any probable
investments, there can be no assurances as to when we will begin to generate
cash flow from operations for distribution to our limited partners. We do not
expect to have any cash available for distribution before we make our initial
investments. However, we expect that such distributions will begin no later than
the sixth full quarter of our operations.

