"party in interest" under ERISA and a "disqualified person" under the Internal
Revenue Code with respect to investing Plans and IRAs. Whether we are deemed to
hold Plan Assets, if we or our affiliates are affiliated with a Plan or IRA
investor, we might be a "disqualified person" or "party-in-interest" with
respect to such Plan or IRA investor, resulting in a prohibited transaction
