capital assets held for more than twelve months, or may be taxed at a maximum
marginal rate of 18.0% if the capital asset disposed of is acquired after
December 31, 2000, and is held for a period of at least five years prior to its
disposition. The Internal Revenue Code also provides, however, that the portion
of long-term capital gain arising from the sale or exchange of depreciable real
