         Net loss for each applicable accounting period shall be allocated to
         the Partners as follows:

                  (a) To the Partners having positive balances in their capital
         accounts (in proportion to the aggregate positive balances in all
         capital accounts) in an amount not to exceed such positive balance as
         of the last day of the fiscal year; and

                  (b) Then, eighty-five percent (85.0%) to the Limited Partners
         and fifteen percent (15.0%) to the General Partners.

         Net income for each applicable accounting period shall be allocated to
         the Partners as follows:

                  (a) To the Partners to the extent of and in proportion to
