including market demand analyses, (ii) the physical condition of any existing
structures, appurtenances and service systems, (iii) the availability of
contractors and engineers, (iv) zoning and other governmental restrictions
applicable to the use or development of the property, (v) income and expense
forecasts and (vi) other appropriate review and evaluation of potential
investment; and (c) structuring and negotiating the terms and conditions under
which investments in Partnership Properties will be made. In consideration for
such services, including services rendered with respect to properties which are
considered for acquisition by the Partnership but are not acquired, the General
